get.description:
The Play View's Boons tab: the form to report a boon, and what the troupe lets
its players see of the character's boons. Staff on a PC see what its player does;
on an NPC they run, everything.

post.description:
A one-time link, good for a day, that lets the player set a new password.
The custodian passes it on, or has Horatio email it to the player's address;
it replaces any earlier link.
